        "question_HdRmwV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What do users say about Hyperlight Optics® glasses?",
            "text": "<p>Hyperlight Optics® glasses are designed for everyone — regardless of age or profession. Our technology provides professional versatility and age inclusivity, making them ideal for anyone who wants to protect their vision and enhance their overall health.</p><p>In today’s world, most of us spend significant time in front of computer screens, smartphones, and other digital devices. Additionally, we are exposed to harmful light spectra from LED lighting and natural UV radiation, which can cause:</p><ul><li>Eye fatigue and headaches</li><li>Insomnia and sleep disturbances due to blue light</li><li>Hormonal imbalance and decreased energy</li><li>Worsening migraine symptoms and increased stress</li></ul><p>Hyperlight Optics® glasses provide effective protection from these effects by transforming harmful light into \"hyperharmonized\" light that is beneficial to your body. Users report improvements in daily life, including better sleep, reduced migraine symptoms, and increased productivity.</p><p>Here’s what some of them say:</p><ul><li><strong>Ivana Maksimović</strong>, Olympic vice-champion: <em>\"Wearing them strengthens my mental focus — I simply shoot better!\"</em></li><li><strong>Scott Thomson</strong>, pilot: <em>\"A truly transformative and indispensable accessory. Sharper vision and good light transitioning!\"</em></li><li><strong>Angelina Lukas</strong>, boxing champion: <em>\"If I could wear my Hyperlight eyewear in the ring, I would! It helps me focus and stay resilient.\"</em></li></ul><p>Hyperlight Optics® glasses are not just for athletes and professionals. They are designed for all generations, including students who need enhanced concentration, business professionals spending hours in front of screens, parents seeking eye protection, and children exposed to digital devices.</p><p><strong>Special benefits include:</strong></p><ul><li>Help with jet lag: regulating melatonin for faster adaptation to time zones</li><li>Reducing migraine symptoms: filtering light that often triggers attacks</li><li>Improving focus and decision-making during work or study</li></ul>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_VbkTmU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I share my experience with Hyperlight Optics® glasses?",
            "text": "<p>You can share your reviews on our official website or on social media using the hashtag #HyperlightExperience. Your experiences help others find the best protection for their vision and overall health!</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
